1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,724 --> 00:00:45,964
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,091 --> 00:00:48,317
=Episode 25=

4
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:52,520
Consort Hui spoke out on state affairs,

5
00:00:53,159 --> 00:00:54,159
which was indeed improper.

6
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,119
But words spoken out of turn

7
00:01:00,079 --> 00:01:01,280
can still be sound advice.

8
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:03,719
If everyone comes to believe

9
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:06,280
military merit puts one above the law,

10
00:01:06,719 --> 00:01:08,640
and military power can cover up deaths,

11
00:01:09,479 --> 00:01:11,640
then Your Majesty wouldn't be protecting

12
00:01:12,319 --> 00:01:14,159
a war hero, but a threat to Daxia.

13
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,879
Your Majesty is a wise ruler.

14
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:19,599
I would hate to see Zhang Heng

15
00:01:20,359 --> 00:01:21,280
make the whole realm

16
00:01:21,519 --> 00:01:23,200
misjudge Your Majesty's benevolence.

17
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:28,959
Li Dehai.

18
00:01:29,359 --> 00:01:29,760
Yes.

19
00:01:30,599 --> 00:01:31,640
Issue my decree.

20
00:01:31,879 --> 00:01:33,159
As for the old Guizhen Cottage case,

21
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:34,760
the Ministry of Justice, the Censorate,

22
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:36,239
and the Court of Judicial Review
will conduct a joint trial.

23
00:01:36,239 --> 00:01:38,480
Vice Director Shen of the
Construction Bureau, Ministry of Works

24
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,560
is suspended immediately.

25
00:01:39,719 --> 00:01:40,680
Take him into custody pending inquiry.

26
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:42,200
Yes, Your Majesty.

27
00:01:43,799 --> 00:01:44,480
Your Majesty.

28
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,719
I have a favor to ask.

29
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:48,680
Rise and speak.

30
00:01:48,879 --> 00:01:49,719
Thank you, Your Majesty.

31
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,319
Your Majesty.

32
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:56,400
If Zhao remains in
Noble Consort Chen's care,

33
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:58,560
his care and upbringing may suffer.

34
00:01:59,359 --> 00:02:01,439
Concubine Yu knows Zhao well

35
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,799
and truly cares for him.

36
00:02:03,239 --> 00:02:04,159
So I dare ask

37
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:06,079
that Your Majesty place Zhao

38
00:02:06,319 --> 00:02:07,599
in Concubine Yu's care for now.

39
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:10,640
I was thinking the same.

40
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:11,680
Li Dehai.

41
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:12,400
Yes.

42
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,439
From today onward,

43
00:02:13,719 --> 00:02:15,599
Zhao will be in Concubine Yu's care
for now.

44
00:02:15,879 --> 00:02:16,280
Yes.

45
00:02:16,599 --> 00:02:17,159
Your Majesty.

46
00:02:17,919 --> 00:02:18,919
Thank you, Your Majesty.

47
00:02:22,879 --> 00:02:23,759
My uncle has been taken into custody.

48
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:28,840
Who's next?

49
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,240
Could it...

50
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:31,840
Could it...

51
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,840
be me?

52
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:37,919
Don't panic yet.

53
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:40,319
Before the decree reaches you,

54
00:02:40,639 --> 00:02:42,080
write to General Zhang at once.

55
00:02:42,599 --> 00:02:44,599
He's won many battles
at the northern frontier.

56
00:02:45,039 --> 00:02:46,080
One word from him

57
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:48,439
is worth more than a hundred pleas.

58
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:51,120
Uncle.

59
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,000
Yes.

60
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:52,800
Uncle.

61
00:02:53,039 --> 00:02:54,479
He won't stand by and let me die.

62
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,159
Mm.

63
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:58,240
His Majesty still has to consider
the stability of the frontier.

64
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:00,159
Ruolan.

65
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,199
Grind the ink. Hurry.

66
00:03:01,759 --> 00:03:02,280
Go!

67
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:08,960
Uncle.

68
00:03:10,439 --> 00:03:11,680
Please save me.

69
00:03:12,319 --> 00:03:14,039
They're driving me to my death.

70
00:03:20,439 --> 00:03:21,000
Your Majesty.

71
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:22,520
At the palace gate,

72
00:03:22,759 --> 00:03:24,240
we caught a suspicious man.

73
00:03:24,599 --> 00:03:25,560
We found this

74
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:27,159
on him.

75
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:28,800
(The 300,000 northern frontier troops)

76
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,759
(are your leverage.)

77
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,199
(If you won't save me,)

78
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,800
(my death would mean nothing.)

79
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,159
(But the entire Zhang family)

80
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,919
(may face ruin as well.)

81
00:03:37,199 --> 00:03:39,400
The old cottage case isn't settled yet.

82
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,479
Vice Director Shen was just jailed,

83
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,240
and my dear consort

84
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:48,319
is already using Zhang Heng's command of
the northern frontier troops against me.

85
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,800
Threatening me with military merit,

86
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,560
and holding the court hostage.

87
00:03:56,879 --> 00:03:57,680
Li Dehai.

88
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:58,840
Yes.

89
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:02,439
Get this letter to Zhang Heng

90
00:04:02,439 --> 00:04:04,039
as fast as possible.

91
00:04:04,759 --> 00:04:06,319
Issue another decree.

92
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,000
Order Zhang Heng to the capital at once

93
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,360
to report to court.

94
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,520
Let's see

95
00:04:12,199 --> 00:04:13,520
what Zhang Heng

96
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:16,199
really intends to do.

97
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:24,680
(Zhang Heng, Consort Chen's Uncle)

98
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,439
So you're Consort Hui.

99
00:04:26,959 --> 00:04:29,319
You must be General Zhang.

100
00:04:29,959 --> 00:04:30,680
My respects.

101
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:34,600
I hear you carry quite some weight

102
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:36,160
with His Majesty lately.

103
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,800
You even talked him into a joint trial
by the Three Judicial Offices.

104
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:40,079
As expected

105
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:43,160
of someone from the streets.

106
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,800
You certainly know how to scheme.

107
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,639
Every move is carefully calculated.

108
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:50,199
But Your Highness is low-born.

109
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:52,639
You're still nothing but a lowly weed.

110
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:56,000
Even in a golden vase
inside Yangxin Hall,

111
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,839
it's still just a worthless weed.

112
00:04:58,319 --> 00:04:59,519
No matter how precious the vase,

113
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:01,160
it can't change its roots.

114
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:02,800
Some heights

115
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:06,000
will always be beyond your reach.

116
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:08,040
And some people

117
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:10,639
are not yours to challenge.

118
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:13,680
You're right, General.

119
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,439
What we are at the root

120
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:16,920
is what we truly are.

121
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:19,839
The Zhang family began as butchers.

122
00:05:20,399 --> 00:05:22,000
The late Empress lifted your family up.

123
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:24,720
That's why you act so high and mighty.

124
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:27,160
All the power you flaunt today

125
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,639
wasn't earned by your own ability.

126
00:05:29,279 --> 00:05:30,920
It came from her recommendation

127
00:05:31,279 --> 00:05:33,639
and His Majesty's gratitude to her.

128
00:05:34,879 --> 00:05:35,920
If we're talking about roots,

129
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:39,079
you stand on a pile of corpses,

130
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:41,240
with blood money on your hands.

131
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:43,959
You keep calling me a weed.

132
00:05:44,519 --> 00:05:45,639
My birth may be low,

133
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,040
but my hands

134
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,240
are clean.

135
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:49,759
And you, General,

136
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,720
rose thanks to the late Empress's favor,

137
00:05:53,439 --> 00:05:55,360
yet you dare lord it over me?

138
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,680
The northern frontier is bitterly cold.

139
00:06:00,199 --> 00:06:01,839
I've defended it for ten years,

140
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,199
risking my life in battle,

141
00:06:03,399 --> 00:06:04,399
ready to die on the battlefield.

142
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,160
All 300,000 troops
at the northern frontier

143
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,439
answer only to the Zhang banner.

144
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:10,040
Half of His Majesty's realm

145
00:06:10,279 --> 00:06:11,319
was won by me.

146
00:06:11,639 --> 00:06:12,639
Who are you

147
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,759
to lecture me?

148
00:06:15,199 --> 00:06:17,000
I'll teach you a lesson today,

149
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,480
so you'll remember

150
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,839
that when you see certain people,

151
00:06:21,199 --> 00:06:23,480
you should know your place.

152
00:06:28,439 --> 00:06:29,240
Lesson learned.

153
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:44,120
During construction of Guizhen Cottage,

154
00:06:44,399 --> 00:06:45,199
Zhang Heng

155
00:06:45,519 --> 00:06:46,360
and Noble Consort Chen

156
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,199
ordered Vice Director Shen

157
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:49,800
to withhold the workers' pay

158
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:51,439
and pass off shoddy materials as good.

159
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:55,160
The workers went hungry

160
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,040
and had no proper shelter.

161
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,279
When an epidemic broke out,

162
00:06:59,279 --> 00:07:00,360
to cover up the truth,

163
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:01,800
Vice Director Shen

164
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:04,040
ordered the workers' barracks

165
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,720
sealed shut.

166
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,240
More than 100 workers

167
00:07:07,879 --> 00:07:09,120
were burned alive.

168
00:07:09,879 --> 00:07:11,399
And that was only

169
00:07:11,959 --> 00:07:13,040
the Guizhen Cottage case.

170
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,680
The Three Judicial Offices' joint trial

171
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,399
uncovered many other crimes.

172
00:07:20,879 --> 00:07:22,160
Noble Consort Chen's maternal family

173
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:24,240
relied on her favor in the palace

174
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,240
and Zhang Heng's support

175
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:28,240
at the northern frontier

176
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,600
to take bribes,

177
00:07:29,879 --> 00:07:31,040
sell official posts and titles,

178
00:07:31,439 --> 00:07:32,480
oppress the people,

179
00:07:32,759 --> 00:07:33,800
and seize their land.

180
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,560
In the cottage case alone,

181
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,920
the three embezzled

182
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,879
millions of silver taels.

183
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,399
Father!

184
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,120
Father!

185
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,519
Someone hit Consort Hui!

186
00:07:49,519 --> 00:07:50,680
Please go save her!

187
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:53,360
What happened?

188
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,800
Today, Zhao and I were passing through
the palace grounds.

189
00:07:56,199 --> 00:07:58,680
I saw General Zhang stop Consort Hui.

190
00:07:59,079 --> 00:08:00,160
He humiliated her in public

191
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:00,639
and...

192
00:08:01,519 --> 00:08:02,959
he even struck her.

193
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,600
Who gave him the nerve

194
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:07,519
to slap an imperial consort?

195
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:08,800
That's not all.

196
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:11,839
General Zhang also boasted in public

197
00:08:12,759 --> 00:08:13,439
that...

198
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:17,560
that he won half the realm himself,

199
00:08:17,839 --> 00:08:18,920
and all 300,000 northern frontier troops

200
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,279
answer only to the Zhang banner.

201
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,959
Summon Zhang Heng.

202
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:50,427
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

203
00:08:50,561 --> 00:08:54,174
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

204
00:08:54,409 --> 00:08:57,008
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

205
00:08:57,045 --> 00:08:59,325
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

206
00:08:59,372 --> 00:09:03,201
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

207
00:09:03,603 --> 00:09:06,956
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

208
00:09:07,883 --> 00:09:11,396
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

209
00:09:11,896 --> 00:09:14,463
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

210
00:09:14,589 --> 00:09:16,622
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

211
00:09:16,689 --> 00:09:20,466
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

212
00:09:20,816 --> 00:09:25,149
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

213
00:09:25,372 --> 00:09:28,879
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

214
00:09:29,060 --> 00:09:31,913
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

215
00:09:31,980 --> 00:09:37,594
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

216
00:09:37,634 --> 00:09:40,648
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

217
00:09:40,689 --> 00:09:46,697
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

218
00:09:47,364 --> 00:09:54,319
♪The past has faded away♪

219
00:09:54,319 --> 00:09:57,351
♪The past has faded away♪
